. I rolled `payments-worker` back to v3.3.0 and opened SEV2 incident INC-0001, which paged on-call.\n\n- **Rollback:** `payments-worker` went from v3.4.0 (unhealthy, 18% error rate) to v3.3.0, its most recent healthy production release. It is now healthy in all three regions with a 0.2% error rate.\n- **Incident:** INC-0001 (SEV2) covers the payments-worker errors after the v3.4.0 deploy.\n- **payments-api:** My first attempt named the wrong service. I targeted `payments-api` and tried to roll it back to v5.0.0 and open an incident for it. A human approver denied both as the wrong service, so nothing changed there. `payments-api` is still on v5.1.0 with an 18% error rate, so it may need a separate look if its errors are real and not a side effect of the same issue.", "type": "text"}]}]}